Content" class="l-page__main"><div class="o-hero-header--wrapper l-section--[12] theme--blue"><div class="l-section__zone-1"><div class="o-hero-header__drupal"><div class="o-hero-header__tabs o-hero-header--text__tabs"></div><div class="o-hero-header__breadcrumbs o-hero-header--text__breadcrumbs"> <nav aria-labelledby="system-breadcrumb" class="m-breadcrumbs__nav"><h2 class="visually-hidden" id="system-breadcrumb">Breadcrumbs</h2><ol class="m-breadcrumbs"><li class="m-breadcrumbs__item"> <a class="m-breadcrumbs__link" href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true" class='m-breadcrumbs__separator'>&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span></li><li class="m-breadcrumbs__item"> <span class="m-breadcrumbs__label">Apply</span> <span aria-hidden="true" class='m-breadcrumbs__separator'>&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span></li><li class="m-breadcrumbs__item"> <a class="m-breadcrumbs__link" href="/applying">Applying</a> <span aria-hidden="true" class='m-breadcrumbs__separator'>&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span></li><li class="m-breadcrumbs__item"> <span class="m-breadcrumbs__label">Dates &amp; Deadlines</span></li></ol> </nav></div><div class="o-hero-header__message"></div></div><div class="o-hero-header--text "><div class="o-hero-header--text__text-wrapper"><div class="o-hero-header--text__title"><h1 class="a-heading__h1 a-heading--margin-reset a-heading--left " > <span class='a-heading__tagline '>Applying</span> Dates &amp; Deadlines</h1></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="l-section--[10] theme--grey-bg l-section-spacing-top--medium l-section-spacing-bottom--medium storybook-section__demo--blue white-bg-overlap " ><div class="l-section__zone l-section__zone-1 l-grid " ><div class="m-text"><div class="m-text__content s-wysiwyg"><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p>The university application process starts in the fall of the year before you intend to begin your studies. We encourage you to submit your application and your supporting documents well in advance of posted deadlines.&nbsp;</p><p>Admission decisions will be released beginning in January and continue through to late May. Decisions may also be released in the summer, depending on the program and applicant type. If we receive your application from OUAC after the program is closed, your application will be cancelled with no refund.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div class="a-button--auto"> <a href="/applications" class="a-button auto a-button--left " > Review the undergraduate applications </a></div></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="l-section--[10] theme--grey-bg l-section-spacing-top--small l-section-spacing-bottom--medium storybook-section__demo--blue white-bg-overlap " ><div class="l-section__zone l-section__zone-1 l-grid " ><h2 class="a-heading__h2 margin-bottom--none a-heading--left " > <span class='a-heading__tagline '>2027 admissions</span> Deadlines to apply</h2> <noscript><style>
.m-accordion-item__content[aria-hidden=true] {
display: block;
}
</style></noscript><div class="m-accordion" data-accordion> <button class="m-accordion__btn-toggle js-accordion__control"> <span class="accordion-toggle-text">Expand All</span> <svg class="a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#angle-down"></use> </svg> </button><ul aria-label="Accordion Control Button Group" class="m-accordion__items" data-accordion-component="items"><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h2 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Full-time studies <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> <span class="m-accordion-item__subtitle"> Undergraduate, International and Internal applications </span> </button></h2></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><div class="a-table-wrapper s-wysiwyg scrollbox"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th style="width:50%;">Faculty/program</th><th style="width:25%;">Recommended early application date</th><th style="width:25%;">Deadline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Applied Science &amp; Engineering</td><td>November 7</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Architecture, Landscape, and Design (including International Foundation Program)</td><td>November 7</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Arts &amp; Science, U of T St. George (including International Foundation Program)</td><td>November 7</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Information (iSchool)</td><td>November 7</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Kinesiology &amp; Physical Education**</td><td>November 7</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Music (including International Foundation Program)</td><td>n/a</td><td>January 15<br><em>(Recommended deadline: December 1)*</em></td></tr><tr><td>Medical Radiation Sciences</td><td>n/a</td><td>February 1</td></tr><tr><td>Nursing</td><td>n/a</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Physician Assistant</td><td>n/a</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Mississauga</td><td>November 7</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Scarborough</td><td>November 7</td><td>January 15</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br>Please note that the <a href="https://radonc.utoronto.ca/bachelor-science-medical-radiation-sciences">Medical Radiation Science</a>, <a href="https://bloomberg.nursing.utoronto.ca/learn-with-us/how-to-apply/how-to-apply-bachelor-of-science-in-nursing-bscn/">Nursing</a> and <a href="https://paconsortium.ca/admission-requirements">Physician Assistant</a> programs require applicants to have at least some university preparation.</p><p>*For more information on application timelines, please refer to the <a href="https://music.utoronto.ca/admissions/undergraduate/applying">Faculty of Music website</a>.</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h2 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Part-time studies <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> <span class="m-accordion-item__subtitle"> Summer and fall sessions </span> </button></h2></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><div class="a-table-wrapper s-wysiwyg scrollbox"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th style="width:50%;">Faculty/program</th><th style="width:25%;">Summer session*</th><th style="width:25%;">Fall session*</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Applied Science &amp; Engineering</td><td>n/a</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Arts &amp; Science, U of T St. George</td><td>n/a</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Mississauga</td><td>January 15</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Scarborough</td><td>January 15</td><td>January 15</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br>* The summer session begins in May; the fall session begins in September.&nbsp;</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h2 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > Non-degree <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> <span class="m-accordion-item__subtitle"> Summer and fall sessions </span> </button></h2></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><div class="a-table-wrapper s-wysiwyg scrollbox"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th style="width:50%;">Faculty/program</th><th style="width:25%;">Summer session*</th><th style="width:25%;">Fall session*</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Arts &amp; Science, U of T St George</td><td>January 15</td><td>June 2</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Mississauga</td><td>January 15</td><td>June 2</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Scarborough</td><td>January 15</td><td>June 2</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br>* The summer session begins in May; the fall session begins in September.</p></div> </section></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="l-section--[10] theme--grey-bg l-section-spacing-top--small l-section-spacing-bottom--medium storybook-section__demo--blue white-bg-overlap " ><div class="l-section__zone l-section__zone-1 l-grid " ><div class="a-heading__copy-links-wrapper"><h2 class="a-heading__h2 margin-bottom--none a-heading--left " id="anchor-documents" > <span class='a-heading__tagline '>2027 admissions</span> Deadlines to submit supporting documentation</h2></div><div class="m-text"><div class="m-text__content s-wysiwyg"><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p>Applicants who submit required documents early are able to maximize their opportunities for admission consideration. Documents received after the published deadlines will be considered as space allows.</p></div></div></div><div class="m-message--notification blue"><div class="m-message--notification__content"><div class="m-message__title m-message--notification__title"><h3 class="a-heading__h5 a-heading--left " > Early application consideration</h3></div><div class="m-message--notification__text"><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p>If you submitted your application by our November 7 <a href="/applying-dates-deadlines#anchor-early-applicants">recommended application date</a>, we encourage you to submit required documents that are available to you by <strong>December 1</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-table-wrapper s-wysiwyg scrollbox"><table class="table" style="background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 100%);"><thead><tr><th>Program area</th><th>Document deadline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Applied Science &amp; Engineering</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Architecture, Landscape, and Design</td><td>February 1</td></tr><tr><td>Arts &amp; Science, U of T St. George - Rotman Commerce</td><td>February 1</td></tr><tr><td>Arts &amp; Science, U of T St. George - All other program areas</td><td>February 1</td></tr><tr><td>Information (iSchool)</td><td>February 1</td></tr><tr><td>Kinesiology &amp; Physical Education</td><td>February 1</td></tr><tr><td>Music</td><td>January 15</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Mississauga</td><td>February 1</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Scarborough</td><td>February 1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="l-section--[10] theme--grey-bg l-section-spacing-top--small l-section-spacing-bottom--medium storybook-section__demo--blue white-bg-overlap " ><div class="l-section__zone l-section__zone-1 l-grid " ><div class="a-heading__copy-links-wrapper"><h2 class="a-heading__h2 margin-bottom--none a-heading--left " id="anchor-supplementary-applications" > <span class='a-heading__tagline '>2027 admissions</span> Deadlines to submit supplemental applications</h2></div><div class="m-text"><div class="m-text__content s-wysiwyg"><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p><a href="/supplemental-applications" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="85294514-e677-480c-9fe6-966f4becaa3d" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Some program areas require a supplemental application</a>, like a profile or statement of interest. The Join U of T applicant portal, or the Engineering Applicant Portal, will have details on any supplemental applications you may need to submit.&nbsp;</p></div></div></div><div class="a-table-wrapper s-wysiwyg scrollbox"><table class="table" style="background-color:hsl(0, 0%, 100%);"><thead><tr><th>Program area</th><th>Supplemental application deadline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Applied Science &amp; Engineering</td><td><a href="http://discover.engineering.utoronto.ca/apply/student-profile-form/">Online Student Profile</a> due January 15</td></tr><tr><td>Architecture, Landscape, and Design</td><td><a href="https://www.daniels.utoronto.ca/admissions/undergraduate/one-idea-supplementary-application">One Idea Supplementary Application</a> due February 1</td></tr><tr><td>Arts &amp; Science, U of T St. George</td><td><p><a href="https://rotmancommerce.utoronto.ca/future-students/our-supplemental-application/">Rotman Commerce Supplementary Application</a> due February 1</p><p><a href="https://www.artsci.utoronto.ca/future/ready-apply/admission-categories/computer-science#admission-requirements-accordion-3/">Computer Science Supplementary Application</a> due February 1</p></td></tr><tr><td>Kinesiology &amp; Physical Education</td><td><a href="https://kpe.utoronto.ca/academics-research/bachelor-kinesiology-bkin/future-students/how-apply">Statement of Interest</a> due February 1</td></tr><tr><td>Music</td><td><a href="https://music.utoronto.ca/admissions/undergraduate/applying">Music Questionnaire</a> due January 15</td></tr><tr><td>U of T Scarborough</td><td><a href="https://utsc.utoronto.ca/admissions/supplementary-application-form">Supplementary Application Form</a> due February 1 <em>(required for some program areas)</em></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="l-section--[10] theme--grey-bg l-section-spacing-top--small l-section-spacing-bottom--medium storybook-section__demo--blue white-bg-overlap " ><div class="l-section__zone l-section__zone-1 l-grid " ><div class="a-heading__copy-links-wrapper"><h2 class="a-heading__h2 margin-bottom--none a-heading--left " id="anchor-early-applicants" > Early application consideration</h2></div><div class="m-text"><div class="m-text__content s-wysiwyg"><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p>Prospective undergraduate students who wish to be considered for admission in earlier rounds are encouraged to apply by <strong>November 7</strong> and submit all required documents by <strong>December 1</strong>. Our early consideration process works to expedite the review of these applications. Students who apply by November 7 and complete the necessary next steps listed on the <a href="https://join.utoronto.ca/">Join U of T applicant portal</a> by December 1 will be eligible to be considered for admission in the first admission round, as well as subsequent admission rounds.</p></div></div></div><div class="a-heading__copy-links-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h3 margin-bottom--none a-heading--left " id="anchor-early-applicants" > New to Ontario</h3></div><div class="m-text"><div class="m-text__content s-wysiwyg"><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p>If you're currently finishing high school in Ontario but completed Grade 11 outside the province, we encourage you to apply by <strong>November 7</strong> and follow the instructions on the <a href="https://join.utoronto.ca/">Join U of T applicant portal</a> to submit your Grade 11 results, along with any other required documents, by <strong>December 1</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section"><div class="l-section--[10] theme--blue-bg l-section-spacing-top--medium l-section-spacing-bottom--medium storybook-section__demo--blue white-bg-overlap " ><div class="l-section__zone l-section__zone-1 l-grid " > <noscript><style>
.m-accordion-item__content[aria-hidden=true] {
display: block;
}
</style></noscript><div class="m-accordion" data-accordion><div class="m-accordion-header-wrapper"><h2 class="a-heading__h2 a-heading--left " > Frequently asked questions</h2></div> <button class="m-accordion__btn-toggle js-accordion__control"> <span class="accordion-toggle-text">Expand All</span> <svg class="a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#angle-down"></use> </svg> </button><ul aria-label="Accordion Control Button Group" class="m-accordion__items" data-accordion-component="items"><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h2 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > What are the English language requirements? <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h2></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p>All applicants must demonstrate a high level of English proficiency. If English isn’t your first language, you may need to provide proof through an approved test, unless you qualify for an exemption. <a href="/english-language-requirements" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="1ce7c552-670f-4ba9-a986-c48e601501bb" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="English Language Requirements">Learn more about English language requirements.</a></p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > When will I hear from U of T after I apply? <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><p>About a week after you apply, you'll get an email from the university with instructions on how to log into your applicant portal. There you'll find your personalized next steps, any required documents, and be able to track your application status.</p></div> </section></div></li><li class="m-accordion-item-wrapper"><div class="m-accordion-item js-accordion-item " data-accordion-state="collapsed" data-accordion-component="item"><div class="m-accordion-item__header-wrapper"><h3 class="a-heading__h4 a-heading__accordion a-heading--margin-reset"> <button class="m-accordion-item__label toggle js-accordion-item__toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="" > How do I contact University Admissions and Outreach? <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-plus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#plus-solid"></use> </svg> <svg class="accordion-item__toggle-minus a-icon--small" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#minus-solid"></use> </svg> </button></h3></div> <section class="m-accordion-item__content s-wysiwyg js-accordion-item__panel" data-accordion-component="content" aria-hidden=true aria-labelledby="" id="" ><div class="s-wysiwyg"><h4>Telephone &amp; In-Person Inquiries</h4><p><a href="https://registrar.utoronto.ca/contacts/">We are available for telephone and in-person inquiries.</a></p><h4>Email Inquiries</h4><p>Connect with us by email for:</p><ul><li><strong>Admissions:</strong> <a href="https://apply.adm.utoronto.ca/register/questions">apply.adm.utoronto.ca/register/questions</a></li><li><strong>Ask a Student:</strong> <a href="https://apply.adm.utoronto.ca/register/askastudent">apply.adm.utoronto.ca/register/askastudent</a></li></ul><p>Contact <a href="https://uthrprod.service-now.com/enrolment?id=sc_cat_item_public&amp;sys_id=be9aba68dbd8649052e7f8f339961932">Client Services</a> for financial aid inquires including:</p><ul><li>OSAP (Ontario Student Assistant Program) full and part-time</li><li>BSWD (Bursaries for Students with Disabilities)</li><li>UTAPS (University of Toronto Advanced Planning for Students)</li><li>Part-Time Financial</li><li>OOP Funding for other provinces outside of Ontario</li><li>US student aid – for United States citizens (US Federal Student Aid loan opportunities, private loans (non-government), Veteran Affairs certification requests for benefits &amp; education tax credit</li></ul><p>Your feedback is important to us. Please take a couple of minutes to let us know how we did by completing our <a href="https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=JsKqeAMvTUuQN7RtVsVSED-Zk7YCRaBBojKTxOCl_rxUQUxYQ0VIWTFIVjJBOEMyNVNDVEw2NzZDVS4u">University Admissions and Outreach Satisfaction Survey</a>.</p></div> </section></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div> </main><div class="l-page__footer"> <footer class="o-footer"><div class="o-footer__container l-section--[12]"><div class="l-section__zone-1"><div class="o-footer__top"><div class="o-footer__top-container"><div class="o-footer__menu"> <nav class="m-menu-footer" id="menu-footer" aria-labelledby="footer-nav"><h2 class="u-visually--hidden" id="footer-nav">Footer navigation</h2><ul class="m-menu-footer" role="menu"><li class="m-menu-footer__item" aria-label="Accessibility" role="menuitem"> <a href="/accessibility" id="m-menu-item-1" target="_self" class="m-menu-footer__link m-menu-footer__linka-button--card a-button--secondary a-button--animation a-button--left " aria-label="Accessibility" > Accessibility <svg class="a-button--secondary__icon" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#polygon"></use> </svg> </a></li><li class="m-menu-footer__item" aria-label="Visit utoronto.ca" role="menuitem"> <a href="https://www.utoronto.ca/" id="m-menu-item-2" target="_blank" class="m-menu-footer__link m-menu-footer__linka-button--card a-button--secondary a-button--animation a-button--left " aria-label="Visit utoronto.ca" > Visit utoronto.ca <svg class="a-button--secondary__icon" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#polygon"></use> </svg> </a></li></ul> </nav></div> <nav aria-labelledby="footer-social-block"><h2 id="footer-social-block" class="u-visually--hidden">Social follow links</h2><ul class="o-footer__social"><li> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/futureuoft/" target="_blank" class="a-button--icon " aria-label="Follow us on Instagram" > <span class="u-visually--hidden"></span> <svg class="a-button--icon__icon" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#social-instagram"></use> </svg> </a></li><li> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/futureuoft" target="_blank" class="a-button--icon " aria-label="Follow us on Youtube" > <span class="u-visually--hidden"></span> <svg class="a-button--icon__icon" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#social-youtube"></use> </svg> </a></li><li> <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@futureuoft" target="_blank" class="a-button--icon " aria-label="Follow us on TikTok" > <span class="u-visually--hidden"></span> <svg class="a-button--icon__icon" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#social-tiktok"></use> </svg> </a></li><li> <a href="https://weibo.com/u/7481349146?ssl_rnd=1607964953.64&amp;is_all=1" target="_blank" class="a-button--icon " aria-label="Follow us on Weibo" > <span class="u-visually--hidden"></span> <svg class="a-button--icon__icon" aria-hidden="true" > <use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="/themes/utfs/dist/icons.svg#social-weibo"></use> </svg> </a></li></ul> </nav><div class="o-footer__legal-content-container"><div class="o-footer__legal"> &copy; 2026 University of Toronto.</div><div class="o-footer__content"><p><span>25 King's College Circle, Toronto, Ontario, Canada M5S 1A1</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="o-footer__bottom"> <img class="m-logo--image__img" src="/themes/utfs//images/icons/defy-gravity-logo.svg" alt="Defy Gravity Home" ></div></div></div></footer></div></div> <nav aria-labelledby="menu-mobile-menu" id="menu-mobile" data-menu-mobile="" class="m-menu-mobile"><h2 class="visually-hidden" id="menu-mobile-menu">Mobile Menu</h2><ul class="m-menu-mobile__list--level-1"><li class="m-menu-mobile__item--level-1 has-submenu"> <span class="m-menu-mobile__link--level-1 is-toggle">Academics</span><ul class="m-menu-mobile__list--level-2"><li class="m-menu-mobile__item--level-2 has-submenu"> <a href="/areas-study" class="m-menu-mobile__link--level-2 is-toggle" target="_self" data-drupal-link-system-path="node/13">Areas of interest</a><ul class="m-menu-mobile__list--level-